OL,5,
OL,6,FFerry services in the Irish Sea are
OL,7,Fcancelled, and there are also
OL,8,Fcancellations on the CalMac service
OL,9,Faround the west coast of Scotland
OL,11,FTens of thousands of properties lost
OL,12,Fpower in south-west England on Friday -
OL,13,Fthousands are still waiting to be
OL,14,Freconnected on Saturday
