OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMum dies after trying to rescue sons
OL,4,Aswept away at sea
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said they believed the woman
OL,7,F- believed to be from Stapleford in
OL,8,FNottinghamshire - was snorkelling with
OL,9,Fher husband and two sons near the
OL,10,Fsouthern point of the island when a
OL,11,Fstrong current reportedly swept both
OL,12,Fchildren away.
OL,14,FIn an attempt to rescue her sons, "the
OL,15,Fwoman was also swept away", police
OL,16,Fsaid. The children were subsequently
OL,17,Frescued from the water.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
