OL,3,AArrest made after fire at Hitler's
OL,4,Amountaintop Eagle's Nest retreat
OL,5,
OL,6,FDifficult terrain was hindering efforts
OL,7,Fto extinguish the blaze and it was
OL,8,Fstill burning early on Saturday, police
OL,9,Fsaid, with some 200 emergency personnel
OL,10,Fdeployed. There were no reports of
OL,11,Finjuries.
OL,13,FThe retreat, above the town of
OL,14,FBerchtesgaden, was one of several
OL,15,Fbuildings in the area used by the Nazi
OL,16,Fdictator and his entourage during World
OL,17,FWar Two.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
